  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Need restaurant hours and incidents.\n\nThanks, Sofia, you're verified. I'm sorry about this. Your order #8701 was lost in delivery. The courier reported that the bag was crushed in a fall, so it never reached you.\n\nI can't send a replacement tonight. Corner Caf\u00e9 closes at 7:50 PM, which is only 20 minutes from now, and a replacement needs the restaurant open for at least 45 more minutes.\n\nI can refund the full amount you were charged, **$34.82**, to your Visa ending in 4242. Would you like me to do that?\n\nThe second $34.82 on your card is only an authorization hold. It has already been voided and will drop off your statement within 1\u20133 business days. You weren't charged twice."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Hm, okay. So they close in 20 minutes and I can't get the food tonight at all? Can't you just send it again? I was really counting on eating tonight."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I know that's frustrating, Sofia, especially when you were counting on dinner tonight. I can't send a replacement. Corner Caf\u00e9 closes at 7:50 PM, and a replacement can only go out if the restaurant stays open at least 45 more minutes. It's 7:30 now, so the kitchen couldn't prepare and deliver a new order in time.\n\nI can do this:\n- **Refund $34.82** to your Visa ending in 4242. That's the full amount, including fees and tip. You could then use it to order from another restaurant tonight.\n\nWould you like me to process the refund now?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ugh, okay. I'd rather have the food, but if that's really not possible, go ahead and refund the $34.82 to my Visa ending in 4242."
  },
