  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've refunded **$34.82** to your Visa ending in 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days. The reference number is RF-4000.\n\nI'm sorry again that dinner fell through tonight. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks. Can you confirm the refund reference RF-4000 is tied to order #8701 and the full $34.82? I just want to be sure it's the right one before I let this go."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, I can confirm it. Refund **RF-4000** is tied to order #8701 from Corner Caf\u00e9. It's for the full **$34.82** that you were charged, and it's going back to your Visa ending in 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with tonight?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that works for me. I'm still bummed about dinner, but I appreciate you sorting out the refund. Have a good night."
  },
